{
 "model": "unified v2 (stage-3): backbone unified_back2.onnx = MobileNetV3-Small with the last 2 inverted-residual blocks (features[10],[11]) fine-tuned end-to-end (1 epoch @1.5e-4, bs128) on top of unified_back.onnx, -> 192-d feature per frame; head unified_head2.onnx = same 1-layer causal GRU (hidden 128) over 30 steps of [feat 192 | aux 15], trained end-to-end with the tuned backbone (init: v1 best head). IMPORTANT: head2 requires back2; switch both together (they are a pair).",
